# Copy to `.dev.vars` (already gitignored) for local `npm run dev` testing.
#
# GITHUB_CLIENT_ID and ALLOWED_DOMAINS live in wrangler.jsonc's `vars` block
# instead (non-sensitive, so `wrangler dev` picks them up from there same as
# production) — only the secret goes here. In production it's set as a
# Secret in the Cloudflare dashboard (Worker → Settings → Variables and
# Secrets). See README.md.

GITHUB_CLIENT_SECRET=
